<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JCI Dec qtr gold mines profit inches up.</title>
<headline>JCI Dec qtr gold mines profit inches up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit before capital spending   132.89 vs 128.24</p>
<p>    Capital spending			   160.66 vs 126.21</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			   11,724 vs 11,049</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			   2,754,000 vs 2,713,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)				 4.26 vs 4.07</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			     47,726 vs 46,961</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)			  56,096 vs 54,982</p>
<p>Full name: JCI Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Aggregate results for JCI Ltd's three gold mines, Randfontein Estates Gold Mining Co Witwatersrand Ltd, Western Areas Gold Mining Company Ltd and HJ Joel Gold Mining Co Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
